sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant CS as CheckoutScreen
    participant VM as CheckoutViewModel
    participant SSH as SavedStateHandle
    participant SSOT
    User->>CS: fill name, address (step 2)
    CS->>VM: onFieldChange(...)
    VM->>SSH: set form and step=2
    Note over SSH: OS kills process - background, low memory
    Note over CS: user returns much later
    CS->>VM: recreated ViewModel(SavedStateHandle)
    VM->>SSH: restore form, step=2
    VM->>SSOT: read cart (durable)
    VM-->>CS: UiState(step=2, prefilled form, cart)
    CS-->>User: resumes exactly where they left off
